# MailerLite — powers the /overheads-review signup via /api/subscribe.
#
# Create at: MailerLite → Integrations → API → Generate new token.
# Needs read+write scope on subscribers, groups and fields (the API route
# creates the groups and custom fields on first use if they don't exist).
#
# Local dev: copy this file to .env and fill in the value.
# Production: set the same variable in Vercel → Project → Settings →
# Environment Variables. It is read server-side only and never reaches
# the browser bundle.
MAILERLITE_API_KEY=

# IndexNow — pings Bing (and other IndexNow engines) with changed URLs after
# each production build, via the astro-indexnow integration.
#
# The same value is both the key and the name of the verification file served
# at https://www.stratumcore.com.au/<key>.txt; astro.config.mjs writes that
# file at build time, so the key is never committed.
#
# Production: set in Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables.
# Leave unset locally — the integration is skipped when it is absent.
INDEXNOW_KEY=
